#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use IBM Cloud Identity Access Management (IAM) to manage users with or "
"without an IBM Cloud account"
msgstr ""
"Usa IBM Cloud Identity Access Management (IAM) para gestionar usuarios con o"
" sin una cuenta de IBM Cloud"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage ID provider users"
msgstr "Gestionar usuarios del proveedor de identidad"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Manage ID provider users {#manage-id-provider-users}"
msgstr ""
"Gestionar usuarios del proveedor de identidad {#manage-id-provider-users}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can integrate with your external identity provider (IDP) to securely "
"authenticate external users to your IBM Cloud account. By using an external "
"provider, you can provide a way for users in your company to use single "
"sign-on (SSO). You can connect your cloud account to an external IDP one of "
"the following ways:\n"
msgstr ""
"Puedes integrarte con tu proveedor de identidad externo (IDP) para "
"autenticar de forma segura a los usuarios externos en tu cuenta de IBM "
"Cloud. Al usar un proveedor externo, puedes ofrecer a los usuarios de tu "
"empresa la posibilidad de utilizar el inicio de sesión único (SSO). Puedes "
"conectar tu cuenta de la nube a un IDP externo de una de las siguientes "
"formas:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the [IBM Cloud&reg; SAML service provider "
"(SP)](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-"
"integration#federate-cloud-saml)\n"
msgstr ""
"Usa el [proveedor de servicios SAML de IBM Cloud&reg; "
"(SP)](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-"
"integration#federate-cloud-saml)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use [App ID](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-"
"integration#federate-appid) (might incur a cost)\n"
msgstr ""
"Usa [App ID](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-"
"integration#federate-appid) (puede generar un costo)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Federate your users to all IBM&reg; products with "
"IBMid](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-"
"integration#federate-ibmid)\n"
msgstr ""
"[Federa tus usuarios a todos los productos de IBM&reg; con "
"IBMid](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-"
"integration#federate-ibmid)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"After connecting your IDP, you can set up dynamic rules so you don't have to manually add every user to every group when they join.  See [Enabling authentication from an external identity provider](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration#app-id-dynamic-rules) for instructions.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"Después de conectar tu IDP, puedes configurar reglas dinámicas para no tener que agregar manualmente cada usuario a cada grupo cuando se une. Consulta [Habilitación de la autenticación desde un proveedor de identidad externo](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration#app-id-dynamic-rules) para ver las instrucciones.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Próximos pasos {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"   * Refer to the [Enabling authentication from an external identity provider](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration) topic.\n"
"   * See [IBM Cloud SAML Federation Guide](https://www.ibm.com/products/tutorials/ibm-cloud-saml-federation-guide) for more information.\n"
"   * Refer to the full [App ID documentation](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/appid?topic=appid-getting-started).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recomendaciones\">\n"
"   * Consulta el tema [Habilitación de la autenticación desde un proveedor de identidad externo](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration).\n"
"   * Revisa la [Guía de federación SAML de IBM Cloud](https://www.ibm.com/products/tutorials/ibm-cloud-saml-federation-guide) para obtener más información.\n"
"   * Consulta la [documentación completa de App ID](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/appid?topic=appid-getting-started).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
